From: FiyeroT <me@fiyero.xyz>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 21:41:19 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 10/63] version, hooks in upstream files: list the features of
 this build

The lines of upstream files that "version: list the features of this build" needs; the feature
itself is its patch of layer 03, in files of its own.

Pdk-Feature: version
Pdk-Zone: tools
Pdk-Layer: 02
---
 cmd/sing-box/cmd_version.go | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/cmd/sing-box/cmd_version.go b/cmd/sing-box/cmd_version.go
index ab5ada2ed..08de6748d 100644
--- a/cmd/sing-box/cmd_version.go
+++ b/cmd/sing-box/cmd_version.go
@@ -60,5 +60,7 @@ func printVersion(cmd *cobra.Command, args []string) {
 		version += "CGO: disabled\n"
 	}
 
+	version += versionLine()
+
 	os.Stdout.WriteString(version)
 }
